{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-234567890123",
    "name": "Patients - Change Email Consent",
    "description": "# Patients — Change Email Consent\n\nUpdates a patient's `is_email_consent` on the **master** DB and syncs the same value across diagnostic branch databases.\n\n## Auth\n- Header: `API-KEY` (required)\n- Body: `token`, `requester` (required on all endpoints)\n\n## Endpoint\n`POST /patients/change_email_consent`\n\n## Payload\n| Field | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| `token` | yes | Auth token |\n| `requester` | yes | User id |\n| `patient_id` | yes | Patient id from **master** DB |\n| `opt` | yes | `in` → `is_email_consent = 1`; anything else (e.g. `out`) → `0` |\n\n## Multi-branch sync\n1. Load patient from master by `patient_id`\n2. Update master `is_email_consent`, `updated_by`, `updated_on`\n3. For each diagnostic branch (`1` mobile, `2` oakridge, `3` mactan, `4` consolacion, `7` mantlewood), update rows where `master_id` = patient id\n\nServer sets `updated_by` / `updated_on` — do not send them in the body.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost/cpci-business-ops-api"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "clinicaRiKOYqlwdTJ-lNedqS0k-it!395!-6ls1JXM7Vcc"
    },
