          "path": [
            "patients",
            "change_email_consent"
          ]
        },
        "description": "## POST `/patients/change_email_consent`\n\nOpts the patient **in** to email consent (`opt=in` → `is_email_consent = 1`).\n\n### Form fields\n| Field | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| `token` | yes | Auth token |\n| `requester` | yes | User id |\n| `patient_id` | yes | Master patient id |\n| `opt` | yes | Use `in` for this request |\n\n### Success\nUpdates master then syncs diagnostic DBs for branches 1, 2, 3, 4, 7."
      },
